    <string name="support_title">Support</string>
    <string name="support_a11y_back">Back</string>
    <string name="support_intro_title">Dear Hiker!</string>
    <string name="support_intro_message">HuKi stays free and ad-free, and support is entirely voluntary. If the app helps you too and you are able to, please consider supporting it.</string>
    <string name="support_reason_spending_title">What is it used for?</string>
    <string name="support_reason_spending_message">My goal with supporting is to make the app self-sustaining, so its costs are covered independently of me. I will keep doing my best to run it as cheaply as possible and to keep the project alive.</string>
    <string name="support_reason_why_title">Why am I doing this?</string>
    <string name="support_reason_why_message">I develop the app as a hobby, in my free time. I have collected many great memories while hiking in Hungary, and with HuKi I would like to give something back: a useful app that helps promote exploring our landscapes.</string>
    <string name="support_reason_rewards_title">What do supporters get?</string>
    <string name="support_reason_rewards_message">As a thank you, you get a supporter icon featuring one of the animals living in our forests, which appears as a decoration in various places in the app.\n\nI remain committed to keep HuKi completely free, so no feature is hidden behind a paywall. Support is voluntary, but every contribution means a lot for the future of the app.</string>
    <string name="support_one_time_title">One-time support</string>
    <string name="support_one_time_note_ios">One-time payment through the App Store.</string>
    <string name="support_one_time_note_android">One-time payment through Google Play.</string>
    <string name="support_recurring_title">Recurring support</string>
    <string name="support_recurring_note_ios">Renews monthly and can be canceled anytime in the App Store. Monthly support helps fund the ongoing development and maintenance of HuKi, such as updating maps and collecting new hiking destinations.</string>
    <string name="support_recurring_note_android">Renews monthly and can be canceled anytime in Google Play. Monthly support helps fund the ongoing development and maintenance of HuKi, such as updating maps and collecting new hiking destinations.</string>
